{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33030","headline":"寄监察从兄 · 曹邺","name":"寄监察从兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我祖居邺地，邺人识文星。\n此地星已落，兼无古时城。\n古风既无根，千载难重生。\n空留建安书，传说七子名。\n贱子生桂州，桂州山水清。\n自觉心貌古，兼合古人情。\n因爲二雅诗，出语有性灵。\n持来向长安，时得长者惊。\n芝草不爲瑞，还共木叶零。\n恨如辙中土，终岁填不平。\n吾宗戴豸冠，忽然入西京。\n怜其羽翼单，抚若亲弟兄。\n松根已坚牢，松叶岂不荣。\n言罢眼无泪，心中如酒酲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}